<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Former Woodside MD joins Amcor board.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Former Woodside MD joins Amcor board.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper and packaging group Amcor Ltd said on Thursday Charles Allen, the recently retired managing director of Woodside Petroleum ltd, will join the board of directors with effect from September 2.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
</text>
